-<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>displays</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css?v=20260922"><script src="search-index.js?v=20260922"></script></head><body><nav><h1><a href="README.html">Sonuvi documentation</a></h1><div class="meta">Canonical source: <code>docs/wiki-source/</code></div><details><summary><strong>Start</strong></summary><ul><li><a href="README.html">README</a></li><li><a href="getting-started.html">Getting Started</a></li><li><a href="using-now-playing.html">Using Sonuvi</a></li><li><a href="core-concepts.html">Core Concepts</a></li></ul></details><details><summary><strong>Displays</strong></summary><ul><li><a href="displays.html">Displays</a></li><li><a href="user-interfaces.html">User Interfaces</a></li><li><a href="kiosk-interface.html">Kiosk</a></li><li><a href="visualizer-in-embedded-mode.html">Visualizer</a></li></ul></details><details><summary><strong>Playback and Library</strong></summary><ul><li><a href="playback-features.html">Playback Features</a></li><li><a href="queue-and-playback-model.html">Queue and Playback</a></li><li><a href="queue-wizard-internals.html">Queue Wizard</a></li><li><a href="media-library.html">Media Library</a></li><li><a href="listen-on-device.html">Listen on Device</a></li></ul></details><details><summary><strong>Integrations</strong></summary><ul><li><a href="integrations.html">Integrations</a></li><li><a href="alexa-interface.html">Alexa</a></li><li><a href="youtube-interface.html">YouTube</a></li><li><a href="radio-interface.html">Radio</a></li><li><a href="mabel-integration.html">Mabel</a></li><li><a href="jukebox-priority-model.html">Jukebox Priority</a></li></ul></details><details><summary><strong>Administration</strong></summary><ul><li><a href="configuration-and-administration.html">Configuration and Administration</a></li><li><a href="config-interface.html">Config</a></li><li><a href="diagnostics-interface.html">Diagnostics</a></li><li><a href="deployment-and-ops.html">Deployment and Ops</a></li></ul></details><details><summary><strong>Developer Reference</strong></summary><ul><li><a href="developer-reference.html">Developer Reference</a></li><li><a href="architecture.html">Architecture</a></li><li><a href="api-service-overview.html">API Overview</a></li><li><a href="api-endpoint-catalog.html">API Catalog</a></li><li><a href="source-map.html">Source Map</a></li></ul></details><details><summary><strong>Troubleshooting and Maintenance</strong></summary><ul><li><a href="troubleshooting-and-technical-notes.html">Troubleshooting</a></li><li><a href="playback-issue-triage-runbook.html">Playback Triage</a></li><li><a href="display-surface-troubleshooting.html">Display Triage</a></li><li><a href="documentation-sources-audit.html">Documentation Audit</a></li><li><a href="wiki-operations.html">Wiki Operations</a></li></ul></details></nav><article><h1 id="displays">Displays</h1><p>Sonuvi has several display and presentation paths. They share playback truth, but they do not share identical layout, routing, or lifecycle behavior.</p><h2 id="display-families">Display families</h2><ul><li><strong>Sonuvi display</strong> — <code>index.html</code> and related render variants.</li><li><strong>Player/Peppy display</strong> — room-facing views routed through <code>display.html</code>.</li><li><strong>Visualizer</strong> — visualizer scenes and presets, including embedded and</li></ul><p>fullscreen behavior.</p><ul><li><strong>Kiosk</strong> — presentation-oriented browsing and controller panes.</li><li><strong>Browser controllers</strong> — desktop, tablet, and phone control surfaces that</li></ul><p>may also be installed as Home Screen web apps.</p><p>Start with <a href="display-interface.html">display-interface.md</a> for the runtime model, then use the branch pages below.</p><h2 id="configure-and-push-a-display">Configure and push a display</h2><ul><li>Builder-first Peppy/Player/Visualizer flow →</li></ul><p><a href="display-enhancement-peppy-player-flow.html">display-enhancement-peppy-player-flow.md</a></p><ul><li>Display router and wrapper ownership →</li></ul><p><a href="display-launch-and-wrapper-surfaces.html">display-launch-and-wrapper-surfaces.md</a></p><ul><li>Kiosk use and launch routing → <a href="kiosk-interface.html">kiosk-interface.md</a> and</li></ul><p><a href="kiosk-launch-and-routing.html">kiosk-launch-and-routing.md</a></p><ul><li>Kiosk authoring and push actions → <a href="kiosk-designer.html">kiosk-designer.md</a></li><li>Visualizer embedded/fullscreen behavior →</li></ul><p><a href="visualizer-in-embedded-mode.html">visualizer-in-embedded-mode.md</a></p><h2 id="iphone-and-ipad-presentation">iPhone and iPad presentation</h2><p>The tablet controller is the direct implementation target for the iPad Home Screen app. Its safe-area geometry remains <code>viewport-fit=cover</code>; its opaque <code>black</code> status-bar treatment avoids the installed-app vignette observed with <code>black-translucent</code>. Distinct manifest identities and icon families are documented in <a href="user-interfaces.html">user-interfaces.md</a>.</p><h2 id="when-a-display-is-wrong">When a display is wrong</h2><ol><li>Determine whether the URL is a router, wrapper, controller, or final render</li></ol><p>target.</p><ol><li>Check whether the page is embedded or top-level.</li><li>Check <code>/now-playing</code>, <code>/next-up</code>, and the active playback mode.</li><li>Check moOde&#x27;s local-display target and host-side overrides.</li></ol><p>Use <a href="display-surface-troubleshooting.html">display-surface-troubleshooting.md</a>, <a href="display-issue-triage-runbook.html">display-issue-triage-runbook.md</a>, and <a href="local-environment.html">local-environment.md</a> for the operational path.</p><p><em>Last reviewed: 2026-09-22 America/Chicago</em></p></article><script>(function(){var p=(location.pathname.split("/").pop()||"README.html");document.querySelectorAll("nav a[href]").forEach(function(a){if(a.getAttribute("href")===p){a.classList.add("nav-current");var d=a.closest("details");if(d)d.open=true;}});})();</script><script>(function(){var i=document.getElementById("nav-search");if(!i)return;})();</script></body></html>
