rity and verification the route is registered beside the existing mobile playlist and queue routes and uses the same bearer verification server tests cover missing malformed and track key only authorization normalized row mapping provider labels opaque ids artwork proxy urls and the absence of mpd paths in serialized json the ios project s swift tests and signed device build must remain green when this endpoint changes last reviewed 2026 10 02 18 45 america chicago",
