+  remote queue;
+- `POST /v1/mobile/qobuz-connect/{play,resume,pause,next,previous,seek}` and
+  `/queue/jump` for the supported transport operations; and
+- `POST /v1/mobile/qobuz-connect/release` for the explicit handoff back to
+  Home moOde.
